    "title": "I-24 multi-car crash slows traffic crossing Ohio River Bridge - NewsBreak",
    "text": "5 hours ago A crash involving several vehicles jammed up traffic and caused delays near the Ohio River Bridge on Wednesday afternoon. The westbound crash just after 4 p.m.involved at least three vehicles. Witness told West Kentucky Star that a cargo van sideswiped a semi before crashing into the back of a car. The car, reportedly occupied by a family from Sparta, Illinois, headed home from vacation, is said to have spun several times before coming to rest facing the opposite direction. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
